  "title": "Lemon and Sage Chicken Broth",
  "blurb": "A light, aromatic soup with shredded chicken, fresh lemon and sage in a clear broth",
  "steps": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat and cook the chopped shallots for 2 minutes until softened.",
    "Pour in the chicken stock and add the sage and black pepper, then bring to a simmer.",
    "Add the chicken breast whole and poach gently for 8 minutes until cooked through.",
    "Remove the chicken, shred it with two forks, then return it to the pan along with the chopped ham.",
    "Squeeze in the lemon juice and simmer for 1 minute, then taste and adjust the seasoning before serving."
